Shrinking final neurons toward their row average is invalid for this regime (`2.1873386003648575e-04`), so the final means have real neuron-specific structure. I’m disabling that and testing a different final-layer control variate: estimate the final preactivation mean/variance from samples and apply the Gaussian ReLU moment formula.
