codex
The public runner shows setup is outside the per-MLP `BudgetContext`; predict FLOPs are what count. I’m going to test setup-time precomputation of the Sobol normal sample matrix seeded from `context.seed`, which removes normal generation and scrambling from each predict. The tradeoff is that all MLPs share the same QMC cloud.
